lns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />Contains exactly two elements"
